<div class="container py-4">
  <h1 class="h4 mb-4">Selects &amp; textareas</h1>

  <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
    Selects use the same stack as v2&nbsp;: <strong>Tom Select</strong> via Stimulus <code>v2--tom-select</code> with
    <code>data-v2--tom-select-simple-value=&quot;true&quot;</code> (generic single/multi). Tag fields in the app omit <code>simple</code> and use icon/colour render + optional create.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label for="ds-select" class="form-label">Select (single)</label>
    <select class="form-select" id="ds-select" name="lookbook_demo_select"
            data-controller="v2--tom-select"
            data-v2--tom-select-simple-value="true"
            data-v2--tom-select-placeholder-value="Choose an option…">
      <option value="">Choose an option…</option>
      <option value="1">Option one</option>
      <option value="2">Option two</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label for="ds-multi" class="form-label">Multiple select</label>
    <select class="form-select" id="ds-multi" name="lookbook_demo_multi[]" multiple aria-label="Multiple"
            data-controller="v2--tom-select"
            data-v2--tom-select-simple-value="true"
            data-v2--tom-select-placeholder-value="Add tags…">
      <option value="a">Tag A</option>
      <option value="b">Tag B</option>
      <option value="c">Tag C</option>
    </select>
    <div class="form-text">Same Tom Select + <code>dropdown_input</code> + <code>remove_button</code> (multi) as configured in <code>tom_select_controller.js</code> simple mode.</div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="h6 text-secondary mt-4 mb-2">Select + <code>input-group-text</code> à droite (icône)</h2>
  <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
    Même motif que les champs v2 avec <code>append:</code> / <code>input_group:</code> sur <code>bootstrap_form</code>&nbsp;:
    <code>.input-group</code> avec le <code>select</code> puis un <code>span.input-group-text</code> (icône Font Awesome).
    Tom Select enveloppe le <code>select</code> en <code>.ts-wrapper</code>&nbsp;; le style <code>lookbook_preview.scss</code> laisse le groupe flexer correctement.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label for="ds-select-ig" class="form-label">Select simple + addon</label>
    <div class="input-group">
      <select class="form-select" id="ds-select-ig" name="lookbook_demo_select_ig"
              data-controller="v2--tom-select"
              data-v2--tom-select-simple-value="true"
              data-v2--tom-select-placeholder-value="Choisir…">
        <option value="">Choisir…</option>
        <option value="1">Option un</option>
        <option value="2">Option deux</option>
      </select>
      <span class="input-group-text" title="Tags" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-tags fa-fw"></i></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label for="ds-multi-ig" class="form-label">Multi-select + addon</label>
    <div class="input-group">
      <select class="form-select" id="ds-multi-ig" name="lookbook_demo_multi_ig[]" multiple aria-label="Tags avec addon"
              data-controller="v2--tom-select"
              data-v2--tom-select-simple-value="true"
              data-v2--tom-select-placeholder-value="Sélectionner des étiquettes…">
        <option value="a">Étiquette A</option>
        <option value="b">Étiquette B</option>
        <option value="c">Étiquette C</option>
      </select>
      <span class="input-group-text" title="Tags" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-tags fa-fw"></i></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label for="ds-select-ig2" class="form-label">Select + addon (autre icône)</label>
    <div class="input-group">
      <select class="form-select" id="ds-select-ig2" name="lookbook_demo_select_ig2"
              data-controller="v2--tom-select"
              data-v2--tom-select-simple-value="true"
              data-v2--tom-select-placeholder-value="Région…">
        <option value="">Région…</option>
        <option value="eu">Europe</option>
        <option value="na">Amérique du Nord</option>
      </select>
      <span class="input-group-text" title="Carte" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-map fa-fw"></i></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-0">
    <label for="ds-ta" class="form-label">Textarea</label>
    <textarea class="form-control" id="ds-ta" rows="3" placeholder="Comment…"></textarea>
  </div>
</div>
